# 2026-08-07 — the "untracked ≠ ignored" sweep (108 files)
# ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# All of the below was untracked AND unignored: one `git add -A` from the PUBLIC
# repo. Scanned first — none carried a key, token, chat-id or the VPS host — so
# this is an IP-exposure fix, not a secret leak. It is proprietary strategy
# logic, live-infra topology and research output. backup-to-private.sh mirrors
# it to the private repo. Same lesson as OFCS_FUNDED_LIVE_RISK.md above: the
# pattern has to exist before the mistake does.

