# ── Edge-bearing files inside packages that are OTHERWISE PUBLIC ────────────
# ⚠️ Deliberately narrow, file-by-file: smc_mtf/, fairvalue_gate/ and
# strategy_adapters/ each already have TRACKED public siblings, so a directory
# rule here would only pretend to close a door that is already open. Ignoring
# these keeps NEW edge out; it does not retract what is already committed.
# See the 2026-08-07 note in MEMORY.md — untracking the 24 published siblings
# is a separate, deliberate decision.
